  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3><span><strong>About Our Brand and Products</strong></span></h3><p>Big Meats BBQ is built for people who live the smoke lifestyle. We create bold, high-quality apparel inspired by backyard pitmasters, weekend warriors, and serious BBQ grinders. Every design reflects real BBQ culture—fire, patience, and pride. This isn’t generic grill merch—it’s for people who take “low and slow” seriously.</p><hr><h3><span><strong>What Makes Us Different</strong></span></h3><ul><li>Authentic BBQ culture — not mass-produced, trend-chasing designs</li><li>Bold, attention-grabbing graphics that actually sell in social feeds</li><li>Built for real pitmasters, not casual “grill once a year” types</li><li>Strong brand identity (humor + grit + pride)</li><li>Designs that naturally spark conversation (great for organic reach)</li></ul><hr><h3><span><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></span></h3><ul><li>Competitive commission on every sale</li><li>Performance bonuses for high-volume affiliates</li><li>Custom discount codes to drive conversions</li><li>Access to new drops early (first to promote = more sales)</li><li>Potential for long-term partnerships + brand ambassador deals</li></ul><hr><h3><span><strong>How to Promote Us</strong></span></h3><ul><li>Post lifestyle content (smokers, brisket cuts, backyard BBQ scenes)</li><li>Wear the gear while cooking — content &gt; ads</li><li>Short-form video (TikTok, Reels) performs best</li><li>Use humor + relatability (BBQ struggles, long cooks, etc.)</li><li>Promote drops, limited designs, and seasonal BBQ moments</li><li>Pair content with food visuals — meat sells the shirt</li></ul><hr><h3><span><strong>Other Information</strong></span></h3><ul><li>Target audience: BBQ lovers, grill masters, outdoor cooks, blue-collar lifestyle</li><li>Best-performing content: real cooking footage + raw, unpolished clips</li><li>Brand tone: bold, fun, slightly edgy but still mainstream-friendly</li><li>We prioritize affiliates who <strong>create content</strong>, not just repost links</li><li>Fast-growing brand with strong potential for viral products</li></ul></div></div>",
